experiment h4_A4_random16:
objective: H4 stage 2 control of A3 (h4_plan.md, addendum 2026-11-07). Same MiMo delta on 16 random directions per tensor (seed 0), rescaled per tensor to the norm of A3's update.
budgets:
    allow_write = true
    max_modified_weights = 9000000000
steps:
    step subspace_transfer tensors=model.layers.* source=hf_cache/mimo-distill-hf basis=random seed=0 norm_like=sig:lab/runs/delta_patterns/sig_mimo.pt k=16 alpha=1.0 out=hf_cache/h4/A4-hf
